  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new round of the programme &quot;Master of Science in Land Management&quot; will start in the autumn of 2007. The support will allow 20 students in three turns succesively to study the handling of real estate in market economies. Participants will be students from Russia, Ukraine, Moldova, Armenia, Georgia, Tadzjikistan, Kirgizstan. The Royal Institute of Technology (KTH)will implement the project.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Se insats 7600351401 En ny omg&#xE5;ng &quot;Master of Science in Land Management&quot; startar h&#xF6;sten 2007 p&#xE5; KTH. 20 studenter i tre &#xE5;rskurser kommer att studera fastighetsbildning i marknadsekonomier. Deltagare &#xE4;r fr&#xE5;n Ryssland, Ukraina, Moldavien, Armenien, Georgien, Tadzjikistan, Kirgizstan. KTH implementerar.</narrative>
  </description>
